                        "crm:E33_Linguistic_Object"
                    ],
                    "exact": "Katherine Anne Porter’s",
                    "prefix": " 65) \n\t\t\t\t The interviewer responds with a question that is asked, in one form or another,\n\t\t\t\t\tnot only of almost every woman included in this book, but of almost every woman\n\t\t\t\t\twriter ever interviewed: \"But haven't you found that being a woman presented to\n\t\t\t\t\tyou, as an artist, certain special problems?\" \n\t\t\t\t",
